<title>CANADA: Exall taking Glimmer to court.</title>
<headline>Exall taking Glimmer to court.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exall Resources Ltd said it began proceedings against Glimmer Resources Inc, Matachewan Consolidated Mines Ltd and George Kent to clarify the Exall/Glimmer joint venture right of first refusal.</p>
<p>Exall has also received proceedings started by Glimmer which seek similar clarification and related remedies.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8109))</p>
